  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Become a monarch butterfly on its migratory journey. The way will be treacherous and there's no slowing down! Keep an eye on your hunger meter, and refill it by grabbing the milkweed flowers scattered around. Beware the monarch's natural enemies, such as wasps and praying mantises. Make it to the end of your migratory path to join your other monarch friends!"
    }
  ],
